# text = He is the greatest tyrant that every lived , she daren't call her soul her own , he makes her tremble with a word and even with a look , he frightens her to death , and she hasn't the spirit to give him a word back , no , not a single word No , Henrietta Simmons , unless I see it with my own eyes and hear it with my own ears , I never will believe it Go on , ladies , go on Mrs Quilp , pray ask the ladies to stop to supper , and have a couple of lobsters and something light and palatable I -- I -- didn't ask them to tea , Quilp So much the better , Mrs Quilp ; these accidental parties are always the pleasantest
