# text = Some of them are now rolling in riches , unmindful of their old companion and friend , ma'am , others are in the habit of calling upon me to this day and saying , " Mr Witherden , some of the pleasantest hours I ever spent in my life were spent in this office -- were spent , Sir , upon this very stool "; but there was never one among the number , ma'am , attached as I have been to many of them , of whom I augured such bright things as I do of your only son Oh dear How happy you do make us when you tell us that , to be sure I tell you , ma'am what I think as an honest man , which , as the poet observes , is the noblest work of God .
