# text = The mountainous Alps on the one hand , or a humming-bird on the other , is nothing , in point of workmanship , to an honest man -- or woman -- or woman Anything that Mr Witherden can say of me I can say , with interest , of him , I am sure It's a happy circumstance , a truly happy circumstance to happen too upon his eight-and-twentieth birthday , and I hope I know how to appreciate it .
