# text = We are here before you , you see , Christopher Yes , sir The gentleman's been kind enough , my dear to ask me whether you were in a good place , or in any place at all , and when I told him no , you were not in any , he was so good as to say that That we wanted a good lad in our house and that perhaps we might think of it , if we found everything as we would wish it to be You see , my good woman that it's necessary to be very careful and particular in such a matter as this , for we're only three in family , and are very quiet regular folks , and it would be a sad thing if we made any kind of mistake , and found things different from what we hoped and expected don't cry , mother , I shall soon be better Well , mother I think my fortune's about made now I should think it was indeed , Kit Six pound a year !
# sent_id = 721
