# text = That's the way to put it Did he say , for instance I don't assert that he did say so , mind ; I only ask you , to refresh your memory -- did he say , for instance , that he was a stranger in London -- that it was not his humour or within his ability to give any references -- that he felt we had a right to require them -- and that , in case anything should happen to him , at any time , he particularly desired that whatever property he had upon the premises should be considered mine , as some slight recompense for the trouble and annoyance I should sustain -- and were you , in short were you induced to accept him on my behalf , as a tenant , upon those conditions Certainly not Why then , Mr Richard it's my opinion that you've mistaken your calling , and will never make a lawyer Not if you live a thousand years Mr Richard this man's not up yet .
