# text = Say , that you had a brother , long forgotten , long unseen , long separated from you , who now , at last , in your utmost need came back to comfort and console you To be to you what you were once to him to repay your old affection , brother dear , by constant care , solicitude , and love ; to be , at your right hand , what he has never ceased to be when oceans rolled between us ; to call to witness his unchanging truth and mindfulness of bygone days , whole years of desolation .
